invariant: INV-54
file: proof/coverage.py
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: the check compares the share of the goto model with the floor
  again, so a harness fails when code it never enters adds locations to
  its model (https://github.com/c4milo/chapulin/issues/197). lint-matrix
  runs main over a stand-in that reaches 50 of 200 locations, 25%, under
  a floor of 50 and requires exit 0.

--- old
            if reached < floor:
--- new
            if float(pct) < floor:
